1942..2016 Comment "/// A path at every loop whose inverse arm drops its rest\'s path: each arm"
2017..2098 Comment "/// checks at its letter, but at `loop ∷ back(loop) ∷ q` the loop arm carries"
2099..2170 Comment "/// the inverse arm\'s reflexivity to `Path.here(loop ∷ back(loop) ∷"
2171..2188 Comment "/// q)`, which is"
2189..2264 Comment "/// not the path at `q` the cancellation\'s right side reads. Read as a set,"
2265..2333 Comment "/// the loops would identify the two; the words are not read as one."
